
    Promise.allSettled Vs any Vs race ??

    More promise combinations you should know.




    Method              Resolves with                       Rejects if                  Use case
    -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

    all()               All values                          Any rejects                 wait for all to succeed
    
    allSettled()        All results (status + value)        Never                       Get all results

    any()               First fulfilled value               All reject                  Need 1 success

    race()              First settled value                 First reject                Whoever finishes first
                        (resolve or reject)





        promise.any([p1,p2,p3])                 // resolves with first success
        promise.race([p1,p2,p3])                // resolves/rejects with first settled